interaction between calcium and cAMP signalling</article-title><source>Nature</source><volume>374</volume><year>1995</year><fpage>421</fpage><lpage>424</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7700350</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Crank1975"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Crank</surname><given-names>J.</given-names></name></person-group><source>The Mathematics of Diffusion</source><year>1975</year><publisher-name>Clarendon Press</publisher-name><publisher-loc>Oxford, UK</publisher-loc>pp. 414</citation></ref><ref id="DeBernardiandBrooker1996"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>DeBernardi</surname><given-names>M.A.</given-names></name><name><surname>Brooker</surname><given-names>G.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Single cell Ca<sup>2+</sup>/cAMP cross-talk monitored by simultaneous Ca<sup>2+</sup>/cAMP fluorescence ratio imaging</article-title><source>Proc. Natl. Acad. Sci. USA</source><volume>93</volume><year>1996</year><fpage>4577</fpage><lpage>4582</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8643446</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="DeBernardiandBrooker1998"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>DeBernardi</surname><given-names>M.A.</given-names></name><name><surname>Brooker</surname><given-names>G.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Simultaneous fluorescence ratio imaging of cyclic AMP and calcium kinetics in single living cells</article-title><source>Adv. Second Messenger Phosphoprotein Res</source><volume>32</volume><year>1998</year><fpage>195</fpage><lpage>213</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9421592</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Debernardietal1993"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Debernardi</surname><given-names>M.A.</given-names></name><name><surname>Munshi</surname><given-names>R.</given-names></name><name><surname>